# Mode11BonusController: 9 targets hit + v_lite37 lit -> step texts 3012 (value 18,000) and 3014 (value 50,000),
# no other step: texts 2.0 s apart (200 frames), total 68,000 added to the score at the last text (3017).
# The game starts in mode 10, where the first a_spot4 contact would be Mode10LaunchBallController's skill shot
# (dragon_ball.cpp:239-: a_spot4 -> AwardSpell, +120,000, mode 2) and add a spell step (3015, 75,000). The subject
# here is Mode11BonusController, so `50 poke info_text_box message_field 2` sets mode 2 before the targets are hit; the
# nine contacts are SpellTargetControl1 hits (dragon_spells.cpp, 2,500 each) and count targets_hit == 9. The score is
# therefore not 0 before the count (nine contacts x 2,500 = 22,500): the n_score check before the last text is
# written as `delta 299`.
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
50 poke info_text_box message_field 2
200 poke v_lite37 light_on 1
210 event a_spot4 ControlCollision
211 event a_spot4 ControlCollision
212 event a_spot4 ControlCollision
213 event a_spot4 ControlCollision
214 event a_spot4 ControlCollision
215 event a_spot4 ControlCollision
216 event a_spot4 ControlCollision
217 event a_spot4 ControlCollision
218 event a_spot4 ControlCollision
219 expect targets_hit == 9
220 poke info_text_box message_field 11
300 event info_text_box ControlMissionComplete
300 expect text info_text_box display id 3012
300 expect bonus_step == 1
498 expect bonus_step == 1
499-500 expect text info_text_box display id 3014
699-700 expect text info_text_box display id 3017
700 expect n_score == 68000 delta 299
701 expect held_bonus == 0
499 expect bonus_step == 3
698 expect bonus_step == 3
698 expect n_score == 0 delta 299
699 expect bonus_step == 8
898 expect bonus_step == 8
898 expect ball_count == 3
899 expect bonus_step == 9
899 expect ball_count == 2
1200 expect ball_count == 2
1300 quit
